Modes: **rule** and **select**. In rule mode you decide what happens to one
`TODO.md` entry, or a cluster of them. In select mode you pick the next piece
of ruled work to do and write the request for it. Outputs are documents — a
ruling or a selection. No code, no commits, no edits to `TODO.md`.

